{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他不再逼自己压下渴望，也不急着决定去留；犹疑了这么久，他仍能为这份亲近感到高兴，这让他很感动。\",\n      \"key\": \"不再逼自己\",\n      \"follows\": false\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他曾因想被珍惜而怀疑自己的关心是不是交换，如今能承认自己也想被珍惜，仍是真心关心对方。\",\n      \"key\": \"想被珍惜\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍不知道对方会不会同样选择自己，却不想因为没有答案就放弃眼前的欢喜。\",\n      \"key\": \"同样选择\",\n      \"follows\": true\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"限制\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-1\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去熟悉的亲近之乐重新出现这一听感对应的描写，保留他不再压抑渴望、不再强迫自己决定，以及犹疑之后仍能为亲近感到高兴的心理变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S11-3\",\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删去浓烈得胸口发疼的身体感受，保留在对方未必选择自己的情况下，仍不愿因没有答案而放弃眼前欢喜的关系选择。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f5f54881-9a93-4afe-856d-a80d78997264", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T022713839294Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.563, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T02:27:49.735343+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": fals